            0.19,
            0.477,
            0.209
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "一、名词解释 (每题3分，共30分)"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "list",
          "index": 6,
          "bbox": [
            0.151,
            0.223,
            0.861,
            0.306
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "index": 7,
              "bbox": [
                0.152,
                0.223,
                0.861,
                0.306
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "1) motor proteins; 2) membrane domain; 3) contact inhibition; 4) voltage-gated channel; 5) molecular chaperone; 6) endosome; 7) MAP kinase; 8) nuclear lamina; 9) gap junction; 10) cell determination"
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "sub_type": "text"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 8,
          "bbox": [
            0.153,
            0.318,
            0.454,
            0.336
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "二、简答题 (每题9分，共90分)"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "list",
          "index": 9,
          "bbox": [
            0.149,
            0.349,
            0.856,
            0.716
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "index": 10,
              "bbox": [
                0.152,
                0.349,
                0.546,
                0.368
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "1) 如何理解细胞质膜的不对称性及其意义？"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "index": 11,
              "bbox": [
                0.15,
                0.381,
                0.506,
                0.399
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "2) 有被小泡的分子结构及其功能如何？"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "index": 12,
              "bbox": [
                0.15,
                0.413,
                0.565,
                0.431
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "3) 为什么说线粒体是一种半自主性的细胞器？"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "index": 13,
              "bbox": [
                0.149,
                0.444,
                0.856,
                0.493
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "4) 微管特异性药物 Colchicine 和 Taxol 被用做癌症治疗药物，叙述这两种药物的作用机理。"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "index": 14,
              "bbox": [
                0.149,
                0.508,
                0.482,
                0.526
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "5) 简述从 DNA 到染色体的包装过程。"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "index": 15,
              "bbox": [
                0.148,
                0.539,
                0.661,
                0.558
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "6) 试述显示一种蛋白质抗原在细胞内分布的两种方法？"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "index": 16,
              "bbox": [
                0.148,
                0.571,
                0.854,
                0.621
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "7) 假设所需条件全部具备，如何得到 S 期同步化的 HeLa 细胞群体？如何证明该细胞群体处于 S 期？"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "index": 17,
              "bbox": [
                0.147,
                0.634,
                0.721,
                0.653
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "8) 何谓 p53 蛋白？举例说明 p53 蛋白在细胞周期调控中的作用。"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "index": 18,
              "bbox": [
                0.147,
                0.666,
                0.661,
                0.684
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "9) 解释癌基因、原癌基因并简述它们与细胞癌变的关系。"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "index": 19,
              "bbox": [
                0.148,
                0.698,
                0.6,
                0.716
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "10) 简述程序性细胞死亡在个体发育过程中的作用。"
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
